Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.86,0:03:03.55,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.69,0:00:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,特意摆成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means something,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.85,0:00:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way it's all set up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.95,0:00:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督派我们来是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The governor was right to send us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的对 提姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn straight, tim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.14,0:00:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这趟来是为民除害\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing a righteous public service here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,「回去」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,手摆成了一个G\N{\fnArial\fs30}The arms are a G.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,腿是O\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legs make an O.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.47,0:00:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后是一个后背 意思是让我们「回去」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's a back. It says "go back".
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.14,0:00:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,太有趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.68,0:00:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她竟然用行尸给咱留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sent us a biter-gram, y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey! You knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.90,0:01:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,发什么神经呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.53,0:01:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督派你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the governor chose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.41,0:01:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是相信你能胜任\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause he thought you were ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.18,0:01:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望你能担当重任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to succeed. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你不停发牢骚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you keep announcing to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.12,0:01:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,说自己吓到尿裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're pissing your pants,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就打得你满地找牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to smash your teeth in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你姓什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now how do you say your last name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.31,0:01:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,加尔朱洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gargulio.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.04,0:01:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是继续叫你尼尔吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm gonna keep calling you Neil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.57,0:01:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.80,0:01:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样 米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the deal, Michonne? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要从树林突袭 以一敌四吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna leap out of the woods, one against four,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.41,0:01:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可都全副武装\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us armed to the teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.39,0:01:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就只有一把杀猪刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you with just your little pig-sticker?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,机会渺茫啊 米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩够了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}We having fun yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.86,0:03:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 有谁在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Is… is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.67,0:03:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes. Who is…?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.89,0:03:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没想到有人会接\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe someone would pick up,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.85,0:03:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从灾难发生后一直在打\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've been calling since it all started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.19,0:03:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能在千里之外呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could be 1, 000 miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你我们的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to say where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.92,0:03:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在安全的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you some place safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.15,0:03:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.89,0:03:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们靠谨慎才活到现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And part of it is because we're careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你我们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的地方为什么安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}What ma… what makes your place so safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}away…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.35,0:03:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.65,0:04:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个刚出生的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I have a newborn baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.91,0:04:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟一群人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with a good group of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们愿意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you be willing…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.31,0:04:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们愿意让其他人加入吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you take the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.13,0:04:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会尽力帮助你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can pull our weight. We can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得跟组织商量一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have to talk to the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们听电话 我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, put them on. Let me make a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,先让我和他们谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me talk to them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 别挂电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, don't… don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 我们是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… please, we're good people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要帮助 我们会帮助你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need some help and we can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两小时后给你回话 - 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll call back in two hours. - Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白 你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. You don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.45,0:04:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.49,0:05:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.21,0:05:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把锅炉房清理干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cleared out the boiler block.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.61,0:05:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有多少行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many were there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不确定 一打或是两打吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. A dozen, two dozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.85,0:05:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.45,0:05:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是过来看一下卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanted to check on Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.48,0:05:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 我们可以去把尸体搬出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, we can handle taking out the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.79,0:05:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不必做 - 不 我一定要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't have to. - No, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,每人都有枪和刀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone have a gun and a knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.74,0:05:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 不过我们子弹快用光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We're running low on ammo, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬和我准备下午出去一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie and me were planning on making a run this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到个电话本 可以去上面一些地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found a phone book with some places we can hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,找找子弹和婴儿食品\N{\fnArial\fs30}look for bullets and formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.53,0:05:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把发电机房清出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cleared out the generator room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿克塞尔在那修着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Axel's there trying to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.67,0:05:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case of emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也会把下层清理一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna sweep the lower levels as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 她中枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. She's hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.19,0:06:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,走不快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slowed her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,提姆和克罗利 他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim and Crowley, they…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.13,0:06:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上就到危险区域了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're close to the red zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.82,0:06:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪声会把周围的行尸们引向我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them shots just pulled every biter in this area our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.88,0:06:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neil!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在必须担当起来 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're gonna rise to the occasion, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.66,0:06:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,事态很严峻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some serious shit's going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你 你明白吗 小兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you here. You read me, amigo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想你死 - 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't want you to die. - Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.49,0:06:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我们从不让自己人变成行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you know, we don't never let our own turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.43,0:06:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atta boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是在逃跑 她是在猎杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She ain't running. She's hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.07,0:06:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也是 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are we. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以加入进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you can join in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.46,0:07:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们又不咬人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.70,0:07:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全祥和是这个小镇的主旨\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's kind of the whole idea of the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.91,0:07:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你似乎也鼓励别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like you also encourage people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.44,0:07:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,自相残杀啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}to punch each other in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.29,0:07:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个角斗场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.55,0:07:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢那个 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't like that much, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太喜欢 但我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not so much, but I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.39,0:07:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我问你点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I want to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.10,0:07:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.77,0:07:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会 你为什么说能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. How do you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会告诉你该怎么管理好你的城镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna tell you how to run your town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.15,0:07:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的城镇 你留下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our town. You stayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.59,0:07:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在也是这里的一分子 告诉我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're part of this now, so tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们用角斗来发泄逃避 这不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's an escape, I don't think it's the right one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是残暴之乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's brutality for fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这世界已经够惨烈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think the world's brutal enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.27,0:07:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,角斗令你很烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really bothered you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我确实想待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do want to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.21,0:07:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么在你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what were you saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谴责我们的野蛮行为之前 你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I made you condemn our sadistic way of life?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做贡献 每个人都在尽一份力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to contribute. Everyone else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以在食物区帮罗比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Robbie could use some help in food distr…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去墙上放哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to work the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我枪法好 我想在这方面尽点力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a good shot. I want to contribute. I want to stay that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能用弓箭吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you use a bow?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.37,0:08:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以找人教你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can get somebody to teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.44,0:08:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是刚才和她通话的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the guy she was talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想来我们这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want to come where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.28,0:08:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她说那儿很安全 - 确实安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She said it was safe. - It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有行尸攻击 没人被咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}No attacks, no one's been bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.39,0:08:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有死伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one's died,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人变行尸 没人发疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one's turned, no one's gone crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.27,0:09:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们想去你们那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we want to come where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.77,0:09:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可能是危险人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀过人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you killed anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.34,0:09:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀过 都是威胁我和我团队的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, people who threatened me or threatened my group.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.75,0:09:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀过多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people have you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.39,0:09:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两个外人想干掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two outsiders who tried to draw on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个把我推向行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}One threw me to walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.97,0:09:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个曾是我们的成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other one, he was one of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.53,0:09:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他迷失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.99,0:09:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷失了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷失了自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.99,0:09:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他威胁我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He threatened me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.67,0:09:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想杀我 所以我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to kill me, so I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是如何失去你的妻子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you lose your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我有妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know I had a wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.86,0:09:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有个儿子和婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a boy and a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你怎么失去你妻子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me how you lost your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.14,0:10:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想谈这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.85,0:10:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.22,0:10:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.94,0:10:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你教我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.94,0:10:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督下令 义不容辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the governor asks me to do something, I do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.32,0:10:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以从明天开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure we can start tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一块训练场地和一些干草垛\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a training area, some hay bales.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有把弓可以让你使\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's even a bow you can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.06,0:10:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我原来的弓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my old one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我爸爸教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. My dad taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.47,0:10:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带我打过猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to take me hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.79,0:10:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想让我参加奥运会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted me to be in the Olympics.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.85,0:10:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把是他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one was his.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我的车还值钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's worth more than my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以为了这弓我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I totally killed him for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.63,0:11:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀他才不是这原因呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't why you killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸已经不是他自己了 哥哥也不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad wasn't himself. My brother wasn't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.33,0:11:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不杀了亲妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to kill my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.94,0:11:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难受 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.45,0:11:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来吧 - 我可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it. - I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.49,0:11:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能越过围墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not supposed to go over the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.15,0:12:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了我能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有毛病吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.29,0:12:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能坐下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.23,0:13:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能感觉得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.31,0:13:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在在动脚趾呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm wiggling my toes right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.65,0:13:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉我膝盖以下还有脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a ghost from the knee down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.77,0:13:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我的命 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对之前的事感到很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was sorry for the things that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她亲口告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.90,0:13:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她打算告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She planned on telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.95,0:13:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来 不要急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your time, whatever you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你支撑着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You carried us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没让我们放弃 你带我们到这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't let us give up. You got us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.51,0:14:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不够 这里不够安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not enough. It's not safe enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么安全的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.90,0:14:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想远离这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you want to get away from this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这一切无法逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we've run already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.67,0:14:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接到了一通电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.99,0:14:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人打电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone called.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.91,0:14:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,打到这个电话上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On this phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.10,0:14:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.15,0:14:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很年轻 她们有一群人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was young. She was part of a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.73,0:14:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说他们找到了一个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said they had a safe place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.01,0:14:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在随机拨打号码 刚好让我接到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said they were just dialing numbers and I picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说他们会再打过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}she said they'd be calling back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果可信的话 我想说服他们收留我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it sounds right, I want to talk them into taking us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说他们住在哪里了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she say where they were?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 不过没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.61,0:14:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果安全 我们就过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's safe, we'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.53,0:14:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别告诉其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell the rest of the group. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.94,0:15:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坐在这陪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll sit here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.07,0:15:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我现在也只能坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's something I'm pretty good at nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.28,0:15:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.05,0:15:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.50,0:16:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.88,0:16:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是昨晚错过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must've missed them last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.41,0:17:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有一两个行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably just one or two of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.66,0:17:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来蔫蔫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look. They got much fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.35,0:17:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让它们先待在这吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ain't going nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.37,0:17:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回来的时候再处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take care of it on the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.76,0:17:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.22,0:17:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈嗜酒如命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, my mom, she liked her wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.61,0:17:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她喜欢躺在床上吸烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}She liked to smoke in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.91,0:17:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,维珍妮女士香烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virginia Slims.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有次我和一群孩子在小区玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was playing out with the kids in the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.32,0:17:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔不在时我就跟他们玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could do that with Merle gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有自行车 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had bikes. I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.04,0:17:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听到警笛声越来越响\N{\fnArial\fs30}We heard sirens getting louder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.96,0:18:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跳上自行车 追过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They jumped on their bikes, ran after it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.71,0:18:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看有没有什么新鲜事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, hoping to see something worth seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.22,0:18:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我追着他们 但是怎么也追不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran after them, but I couldn't keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跑过一个拐角时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran around a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.77,0:18:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到我的朋友们看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and saw my friends looking at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 所有人都在看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I saw everybody looking at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.39,0:18:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是消防车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire trucks everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.52,0:18:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,左邻右舍都跑了过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}People from the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.84,0:18:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,起火的地方是我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my house they were there for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲的烟头点燃了床\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my mom and bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,化为乌有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burnt down to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就这样消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, she was just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.82,0:18:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就此蒸发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.69,0:18:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没剩下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing left of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:18:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们说这样还好受点\N{\fnArial\fs30}People said it was better that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧 只是听上去不那么真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Just made seems like wasn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我射杀了我母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她休克了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有变行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hadn't turned yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.03,0:19:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我结束了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ended it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.65,0:19:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.68,0:19:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你母亲的遭遇我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.39,0:19:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.67,0:19:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.47,0:19:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.99,0:20:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你找我来是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know why you want to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were told.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到万不得已不得走出墙外\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't go over unless we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.77,0:20:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,想活动一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted a little practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.34,0:20:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.29,0:20:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用再去墙上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need you on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.06,0:20:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢那场角斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked the fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.67,0:20:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这感觉令我不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't like that I liked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.13,0:20:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你就是喜欢 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you did. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.57,0:20:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.66,0:20:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本可以离开的 曾经打算离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could have walked out. You started walking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.03,0:20:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你选择了留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you stayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.75,0:20:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你也没离我而去一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you stay here right now to tell me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我也喜欢你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying that I like you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.28,0:21:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你有点喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm growing on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.47,0:21:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得不错啊 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You worth the occasion, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去后和你痛快喝两杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we get back, I'm gonna get you a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.05,0:21:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓紧吧 她坚持不了多久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, she can't have made it that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我们完成任务了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no. We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.11,0:21:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找辆车子 赶紧回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna grab a car, haul ass home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.74,0:21:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天忙活一天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a good day's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.31,0:21:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她杀死了提姆和克罗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she… she killed Tim and Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.98,0:21:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但她的伤也不轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, but we messed her up pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经进入了危险区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, she's headed straight for the red zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.49,0:21:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟总督怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we tell the governor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you think we tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说我们杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him we killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.81,0:21:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 她已经死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, man, she's as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.04,0:21:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我要去追她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.76,0:21:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她脑子不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}She ain't right in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.14,0:21:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.65,0:21:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不值得我们浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't worth our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不值得我们冒生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely ain't worth our blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.64,0:21:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.11,0:21:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,事态严峻 这是你亲口说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is some serious shit. That's what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.39,0:22:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这事上 我不会跟总督撒谎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna lie to the governor about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.71,0:22:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.64,0:22:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能就这么草草了事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't cut corners on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.76,0:22:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你学得很快 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've come along pretty quick there, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.68,0:22:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you say your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.23,0:22:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,加尔朱洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gargulio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.18,0:22:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,加尔朱洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gargulio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.59,0:22:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见鸟叫了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear that bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.74,0:22:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,加尔朱洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gargulio.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.93,0:23:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.22,0:23:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想告诉他你妻子是怎么死的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't want to tell him how your wife died?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.79,0:23:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我刚失去她 但如果必须说我会说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just lost her. But if that's what it takes…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.78,0:23:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.70,0:23:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该谈谈这事 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should talk about it, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.06,0:23:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那听上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.80,0:23:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.68,0:23:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道我名字的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.55,0:24:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.20,0:24:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们进去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.57,0:24:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.12,0:25:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是美妙的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a beautiful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.30,0:25:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 拿上那只鸭子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, get that duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.81,0:25:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啥 - 拿上那只鸭子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Get that duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.83,0:25:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没开玩笑吧 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you serious? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.93,0:25:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个在监狱里长大的小孩需要点玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kid growing up in a prison could use some toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.63,0:25:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是那种每周末都给自己车打蜡的人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the kind of guy who waxed his car every weekend, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.26,0:25:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我的车并不令我特别自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wasn't particularly proud of my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.47,0:26:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的房子 我的工作也如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}or my house, or my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.71,0:26:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我养的狗笨的称得上奇葩\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dog was a wonder of stupidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.60,0:26:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一次连棵树都没打过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost a fight with a tree once.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.59,0:26:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你建造了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.26,0:26:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得让人难以置信的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find it hard to believe that you didn't have a single thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.36,0:26:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没有一样引以为豪的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you were proud of before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.76,0:26:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.92,0:26:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾拥有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.74,0:26:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多久没那啥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.39,0:26:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, since…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.61,0:26:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多久没喝到这么好的威士忌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you had whiskey this good?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.81,0:26:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,久到我已记不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.72,0:26:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴自己忘记了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm happy to forget a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.56,0:26:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅忘记了那些不好的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just the bad stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.19,0:26:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也包括那些美好时光吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the good times?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.57,0:26:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 此时此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I want to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.27,0:26:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.01,0:27:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,手里拿着酒杯 清风拂过枝叶\N{\fnArial\fs30}This glass in my hand, leaves in the breeze,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.01,0:27:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你畅谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.67,0:27:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到很荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel special.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.47,0:27:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,能作总督的听众\N{\fnArial\fs30}An audience with the governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.46,0:27:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.91,0:27:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是叫我菲利普吧 我现在下班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just go with Philip, huh? I'm off the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.13,0:27:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利普 那样更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Philip. That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.33,0:27:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我觉得不那么像个说客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes me feel less like a lobbyist.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.02,0:27:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大可不必为喜欢那角斗而感到羞耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be ashamed about liking the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.82,0:27:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不必为参与其中羞耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or fighting the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.19,0:27:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜爱它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.44,0:27:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活不局限于此 可在当下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the only thing, but nowadays,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.31,0:27:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它又是活着的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's part of being alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.35,0:27:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.21,0:27:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数人都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people don't have it,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.70,0:27:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种能看到全部事实的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}what it takes to see the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.12,0:27:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够与它共存 取其为用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being able to live with it, to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.58,0:27:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么它们众 我们寡\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why there's a hell of a lot more of them than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.70,0:27:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.27,0:27:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.83,0:27:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有这能力 安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you have it, Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.18,0:28:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.27,0:28:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就享受它吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.01,0:28:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,今朝有酒今朝醉 明日死去又何妨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat, drink, and be merry, for tomorrow we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.13,0:28:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没想过死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm not planning on dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.68,0:28:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我也不想 可世事无常\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, neither am I. It just happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.53,0:28:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,万事皆有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.62,0:28:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚中了发现奶粉的头奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just hit: the powder formula jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.07,0:28:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.78,0:28:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还找到了豆子罐头 电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also got beans, batteries,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.94,0:28:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡尾酒小香肠 还有很多芥末酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cocktail wieners, many mustards.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.58,0:28:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这回监狱是一条直路\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a straight shot back to the prison from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.95,0:29:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定能赶上晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly making time for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.15,0:29:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这里的安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.25,0:29:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论在监狱 还是在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back there, back home, you can always hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.65,0:29:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,总能听到它们在围栏外面发出的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}outside the fence no matter where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.68,0:29:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说的这个家在哪儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where is it y'all good people are calling home?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.60,0:29:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.16,0:29:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, back the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.89,0:29:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 好啊 宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.92,0:29:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.83,0:29:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.57,0:29:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能告诉我 我弟弟活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell me, is my brother alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.81,0:29:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.42,0:29:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带他来见我 亚特兰大的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you take me to him and I'll call it even.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.77,0:29:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一笔勾销\N{\fnArial\fs30}on everything that happened up there in Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.40,0:29:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,既往不咎 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hard feelings. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.92,0:29:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.00,0:30:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.43,0:30:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了一家医疗用品仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I found myself a medical supply warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.90,0:30:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己安了这么个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fixed it up myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.74,0:30:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺酷的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.15,0:30:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会告诉达里尔你在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll tell Daryl you're here and.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.17,0:30:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会过来见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll come out to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.43,0:30:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等啊 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Just hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.06,0:30:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,淡定 淡定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up here. Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.90,0:30:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能找到对方就是个奇迹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, the fact that we found each other is a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.58,0:30:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.29,0:30:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.36,0:30:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得信任我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.89,0:30:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你待在原地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.18,0:30:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.02,0:30:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 老兄 别紧张啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hold up, buddy, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.18,0:30:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开她 放开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of her. Let go of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.26,0:30:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,立马把枪放车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun in the car, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.11,0:30:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我把枪放车上 小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it in the car, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.50,0:30:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了 现在来开车兜风吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Now we're gonna go for a little drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.46,0:31:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会带你回我们营地的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going back to our camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.97,0:31:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们去其它地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're going somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.54,0:31:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我上车 格伦 你开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the car, Glenn! You're driving!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.39,0:31:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快去 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move! - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.43,0:31:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.67,0:31:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.99,0:31:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.27,0:31:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我要找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.18,0:31:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.25,0:31:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要拖鞋干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell you need slippers for?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.86,0:31:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日也需要放松嘛 你懂得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, end of the day, relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.31,0:32:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.91,0:32:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是最尽头牢房里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have been in the cell at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.69,0:32:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,其它地方都查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We checked everywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.67,0:32:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是卡萝尔的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Carol's knief.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.43,0:33:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.49,0:33:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.66,0:33:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么认识我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.63,0:33:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也认识他们 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know them, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.08,0:33:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天跟你说话的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people you were talking to today,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.55,0:33:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是艾米 吉姆 杰奎\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Amy, Jim, Jacqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.10,0:33:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.30,0:33:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.86,0:33:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉 洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori? Lori?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.83,0:33:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.96,0:33:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.94,0:33:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那么的爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.82,0:33:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那么的爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.22,0:34:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我撑不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't put it back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.04,0:34:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我撑不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't put it back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.66,0:34:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本以为我可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.24,0:34:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对自己承诺过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a deal with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.15,0:34:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让你活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would keep you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.62,0:34:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找到住处 安顿好一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd find a place. I would fix that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.23,0:34:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.20,0:34:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢开门 我不能冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't open that door, I couldn't risk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.49,0:34:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本要让你活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna keep you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.10,0:34:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,让卡尔 孩子都活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, the baby. And then…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.01,0:34:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为还有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought there'd be time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.11,0:34:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但时间永远不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's never time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.82,0:34:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.25,0:35:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在依然爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.90,0:35:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坚持不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't put it back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.47,0:35:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该早点对你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.50,0:35:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该早点说爱你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should… I should have said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.94,0:35:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.98,0:35:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.32,0:35:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.37,0:35:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.61,0:35:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.04,0:35:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.13,0:35:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.82,0:35:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.01,0:35:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你坚持下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.61,0:35:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你坚持下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.48,0:35:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.18,0:35:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick? Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.02,0:36:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚说我下班了是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied when I said I was off the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.07,0:36:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这工作24小时不间断\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a 24/7 kind of gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.81,0:36:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我躲床底下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I hide under the bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.95,0:36:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.18,0:37:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有别人在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Company?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.21,0:37:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.17,0:37:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的三个人都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost all three guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.82,0:37:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,提姆 克罗利 还有另一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim, Crowley, the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.52,0:37:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,加尔朱洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gargulio.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.65,0:37:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.16,0:37:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她砍翻了提姆 用剑刺死了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she cut Tim down, put her sword through him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.05,0:37:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸冲了过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then biters got in the middle of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.70,0:37:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.48,0:37:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.01,0:37:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们穿上正装 给他们办个英雄般的葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we'll dress it up. Give 'em a hero's funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.40,0:37:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你编个故事 就说在找补给时出了岔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell a story. A supply run gone sideways.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.26,0:37:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.98,0:37:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的人头和那把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her head. The sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.57,0:37:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时兵荒马乱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, we got caught in a crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.66,0:37:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,提姆拿着人头 克罗利拿着刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tim had the head, Crowley had the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.65,0:37:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们全被撕得粉碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}They both got all tore up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.38,0:38:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我找到了点别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something else for you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.07,0:38:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个亚特兰大营地的老相识\N{\fnArial\fs30}A guy I used to know from the atlanta camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.93,0:38:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他貌美如花的小女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his pretty little girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.42,0:38:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们认识安德莉亚吗 - 认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They know Andrea? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.85,0:38:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.28,0:38:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.22,0:38:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是返回路上碰到他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found them on the return trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.49,0:38:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他们的样子 他们似乎过得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the looks of them, they got to be set up pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.73,0:38:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找出他们营地的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find out where.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.17,0:38:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.17,0:38:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.63,0:41:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她长得像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.08,0:41:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱稳了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, just… you got her?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.86,0:41:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.34,0:41:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
